      - title: en
        value: '3. Since Git commands are separated by spaces,

          enclose
          the commit message in quotation <color=#CF001C>"</color> when writing it.

          It
          should look like: ''<color=#CF001C>git commit -m ""</color>'''
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u7B2C 3 \u6B65\uFF1A\n\u7531\u65BC Git \u6307\u4EE4\u662F\u6309\u7167\u7A7A\u683C\u5340\u5206\u4E0D\u540C\u7684\u90E8\u5206\n\u6240\u4EE5\u5728\u586B\u5BEB\u63D0\u4EA4\u8A0A\u606F\u6642\n\u9700\u8981\u901A\u904E
