      - title: en
        value: 'In the Git system,

          this condition is known as ''<color=#CF001C>Detached
          HEAD</color>''.

          It means the current HEAD is not pointing to
          any branch.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u5728 Git \u7CFB\u7D71\u4E2D\n\u9019\u7A2E\u60C5\u6CC1\u7A31\u70BA<color=#CF001C>\u5206\u96E2
          HEAD</color> (Detached HEAD)\n\u8868\u793A\u7576\u524D HEAD \u4E26\u6C92\u6709\u6307\u5230\u4EFB\u4F55\u7684\u5206\u652F"
