      - title: en
        value: '1. The naming of the branch should be concise and clear:

          Like
          commit messages,

          clear naming helps people understand the purpose
          and features of the branch.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "1. \u5206\u652F\u7684\u547D\u540D\u8981\u7C21\u6F54\u3001\u660E\u78BA\n\u548C\u63D0\u4EA4\u8A0A\u606F\u4E00\u6A23\n\u6E05\u6670\u7684\u547D\u540D\u53EF\u4EE5\u8B93\u4EBA\u4E86\u89E3\u5206\u652F\u7684\u76EE\u7684\u548C\u4F5C\u7528"
