          Get the latest ''commit history'' from the remote repository.

          2.
          These records are then merged into the corresponding local branch.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u9019\u500B\u6307\u4EE4\u6703\u4F9D\u5E8F\u57F7\u884C\u4EE5\u4E0B\u64CD\u4F5C\uFF1A\n1.
          \u5F9E\u9060\u7AEF\u5132\u5B58\u5EAB\u7372\u53D6\u6700\u65B0\u7684 '\u63D0\u4EA4\u8A18\u9304'\n2.
