      - title: Response Menu Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: en
        value: 'In this stage, we will complete the following steps:

          1.
          Ensure the version of the ''development branch'' and ''main are the same
          as the remote.

          2. Merge the ''main branch'' into the ''development
          branch'' on the local computer.

          3. Check for any issues in the
          project after merging.

          4. Upload the merged ''development branch''
          to the remote.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u6211\u5011\u5C07\u5728\u672C\u6B21\u95DC\u5361\u4E2D\u9032\u884C\u4EE5\u4E0B\u6B65\u9A5F\uFF1A\n1.
          \u78BA\u8A8D '\u958B\u767C\u5206\u652F' \u548C '\u4E3B\u5206\u652F' \u7684\u8A18\u9304\u8207\u9060\u7AEF\u4E00\u81F4\n2.
          \u5728\u672C\u5730\u96FB\u8166\u4E2D\u5C07 '\u4E3B\u5206\u652F' \u5408\u4F75\u81F3
          '\u958B\u767C\u5206\u652F' \u4E2D\n3. \u67E5\u770B\u5408\u4F75\u5F8C\u7684\u5C08\u6848\u662F\u5426\u51FA\u73FE\u554F\u984C\n4.
          \u5C07\u5408\u4F75\u5F8C\u7684 '\u958B\u767C\u5206\u652F'\uFF0C\u4E0A\u50B3\u81F3\u9060\u7AEF"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
