        typeString: 
      - title: en
        value: 'The current process steps we are working at:

          <color=#CF001C>1.
          Ensure the version of the ''development branch'' and ''main are the same
          as the remote.</color>

          2. Merge the ''main branch'' into the
          ''development branch'' on the local computer.

          3. Check for any
          issues in the project after merging.

          4. Upload the merged ''development
          branch'' to the remote.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u76EE\u524D\u5DF2\u9032\u884C\u7684\u6D41\u7A0B\uFF1A\n<color=#CF001C>1.
          \u78BA\u8A8D '\u958B\u767C\u5206\u652F' \u548C '\u4E3B\u5206\u652F' \u7684\u8A18\u9304\u8207\u9060\u7AEF\u4E00\u81F4</color>\n2.
          \u5728\u672C\u5730\u96FB\u8166\u4E2D\u5C07 '\u4E3B\u5206\u652F' \u5408\u4F75\u81F3
          '\u958B\u767C\u5206\u652F' \u4E2D\n3. \u67E5\u770B\u5408\u4F75\u5F8C\u7684\u5C08\u6848\u662F\u5426\u51FA\u73FE\u554F\u984C\n4.
          \u5C07\u5408\u4F75\u5F8C\u7684 '\u958B\u767C\u5206\u652F'\uFF0C\u4E0A\u50B3\u81F3\u9060\u7AEF"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
