      - title: en
        value: 'The current process steps we are working at:

          1. Ensure
          the version of the ''development branch'' and ''main are the same as the
          remote.

          2. Merge the ''main branch'' into the ''development
          branch'' on the local computer.

          <color=#CF001C>3. Check for
          any issues in the project after merging.</color>

          4. Upload the
          merged ''development branch'' to the remote.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u76EE\u524D\u5DF2\u9032\u884C\u7684\u6D41\u7A0B\uFF1A\n1. \u78BA\u8A8D
