      - title: en
        value: '3. Among Git commands, there is a specific command to remove files
          from the staging area.

          You need to append the name of the file
          you want to remove after the command.

          Please look it up in the
          Game Manual for details.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "3. Git \u6307\u4EE4\u4E2D\uFF0C\u6709\u500B\u5C07\u7279\u5B9A\u6A94\u6848\u79FB\u51FA\u66AB\u5B58\u5340\u57DF\u7684\u6307\u4EE4\n  
