        value: 'To check the contents of the ''Staging Area'',

          you need
          to use the ''<color=#CF001C>git status</color>'' command.

          This
          command allows you to view what is currently inside the staging area.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u82E5\u8981\u78BA\u8A8D '\u66AB\u5B58\u5340\u57DF' \u7684\u5167\u5BB9\n\u60A8\u9700\u8981\u4F7F\u7528
