      - title: en
        value: 'In the ''Command Line'' window,

          please ensure that the
          path is set to the project.

          The project for this stage is located
          at the ''<color=#CF001C>Home</color>'' path.

          (You should be
          able to see the hidden .git folder.)'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u5728 '\u547D\u4EE4\u884C' \u8996\u7A97\u4E2D\uFF0C\u8ACB\u78BA\u4FDD\u5176\u8DEF\u5F91\u4F4D\u65BC\u5C08\u6848\u4E0A\n\u672C\u6B21\u95DC\u5361\u7684\u5C08\u6848\u5275\u5EFA\u65BC
