      - title: en
        value: "3. Among Git commands, \nthere is a specific command to move all
          files inside a folder into the staging area at once.\r\nYou need to append
          the target folder name after the command.\r\nPlease look it up in the Game
          Manual for details."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "3. Git \u6307\u4EE4\u4E2D\uFF0C\u6709\u500B\u5C07\u8CC7\u6599\u593E\u4E2D\u7684\u6A94\u6848\u4E00\u6B21\u6027\u5730\u79FB\u5165\u66AB\u5B58\u5340\u57DF\u7684\u6307\u4EE4\n  
