        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: en
        value: '3. Among Git commands,

          there is a specific command to
          move all files under the current path into the staging area at once.

          You
          need to append the <color=#CF001C>.</color> symbol after the command.

          Please
          look it up in the Game Manual for details.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "3. Git \u6307\u4EE4\u4E2D\uFF0C\u6709\u500B\u5C07\u8DEF\u5F91\u4E0B\u7684\u6240\u6709\u6A94\u6848\u4E00\u6B21\u6027\u5730\u79FB\u5165\u66AB\u5B58\u5340\u57DF\u7684\u6307\u4EE4\n  
