      - title: en
        value: "2. Navigate through the 'File Manager' window\r\nuntil you can see
          the target file in the window.\n\r(The command line path will move along
          with it.)\r"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "2. \u79FB\u52D5 '\u6A94\u6848\u7BA1\u7406' \u8996\u7A97\u7684\u8DEF\u5F91\n  
          \u76F4\u5230\u53EF\u4EE5\u5728 '\u6A94\u6848\u7BA1\u7406' \u8996\u7A97\u770B\u5230\u76EE\u6A19\u7684\u6A94\u6848\n  
