      - title: en
        value: "3. Among Git commands, \n'git add' is used to add files to the staging
          area.\nYou need to append the specified parameters afterward.\nPlease look
          them up in the Game Manual for details."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "3. \u5728 Git \u6307\u4EE4\u4E2D\uFF0C'git add' \u64C1\u6709\u5C07\u6A94\u6848\u79FB\u5165\u66AB\u5B58\u5340\u57DF\u7684\u6307\u4EE4\r\n  
