      - title: en
        value: 'Which of the following descriptions is <color=#CF001C>not</color>
          a feature of version control?

          A. Easy to track changes between
          files.

          B. Requires copying files on the project for management.

          C.
          Often used in large projects.

          D. Convenient for comparing differences
          between versions.'
