      - title: Response Menu Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: en
        value: 'For the rollback feature in version control, which statement is correct?

          A.
          Easy to switch to different versions.

          B. Switching versions
          will discard the content currently being developed.

          C. Similar
          to restoring versions of backup files.

          D. Will take a lot of
          time to switch different versions.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u7248\u672C\u63A7\u5236\u4E2D\u7684\u56DE\u6EAF\u529F\u80FD\uFF0C\u4EE5\u4E0B\u6558\u8FF0\u54EA\u500B\u662F\u6B63\u78BA\u7684\uFF1F\nA.
          \u5BB9\u6613\u5207\u63DB\u5230\u4E0D\u540C\u7684\u7248\u672C\u4E2D\nB.
          \u5207\u63DB\u7248\u672C\u5F8C\uFF0C\u6703\u5C07\u6B63\u5728\u958B\u767C\u7684\u5167\u5BB9\u6368\u68C4\u6389\nC.
          \u548C\u5099\u4EFD\u6A94\u6848\u7684\u56DE\u5FA9\u7248\u672C\u7684\u65B9\u5F0F\u76F8\u4F3C\nD.
          \u5207\u63DB\u7248\u672C\u6703\u82B1\u8CBB\u5F88\u591A\u6642\u9593"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
