        typeString: 
      - title: en
        value: 'In the history tracking feature of version control, which of the
          following is <color=#CF001C>not</color> recorded?

          A. Author
          who created the record.

          B. Modify messages in the record.

          C.
          Time when the record is created.

          D. Each file size in the record.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u7248\u672C\u63A7\u5236\u7684\u6B77\u53F2\u8FFD\u8E64\u529F\u80FD\u4E2D\uFF0C\u5176\u4E2D<color=#CF001C>\u6C92\u6709</color>\u54EA\u9805\u8A18\u9304\uFF1F\nA.
          \u5275\u5EFA\u8A18\u9304\u7684\u4F5C\u8005\nB. \u8A18\u9304\u88E1\u7684\u4FEE\u6539\u5167\u5BB9\nC.
          \u5275\u5EFA\u8A18\u9304\u7684\u6642\u9593\nD. \u8A18\u9304\u4E2D\u7684\u6BCF\u500B\u6587\u4EF6\u5927\u5C0F"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
