        value: '2. In this game, content that needs to be modified will be marked
          with <color=#CF001C>(to be modified)</color>.

          Please find those
          lines and get ready to modify them.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "2. \u5728\u672C\u904A\u6232\u88E1\uFF0C\u9700\u8981\u4FEE\u6539\u7684\u5167\u5BB9\u6703\u7528
