      - title: en
        value: "Once all the files have been added to or removed from the staging
          area\r according to the requirements,\r\nplease execute '<color=#CF001C>git
          status</color>'.\r\nThis command allows you to view what is currently inside
          the staging area.\r"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u7576\u4E0A\u8FF0\u7684\u5167\u5BB9\u90FD\u6839\u64DA\u8981\u6C42\u63A8\u5165\u3001\u79FB\u51FA\u66AB\u5B58\u5340\u57DF\u5F8C\r\n\u8ACB\u57F7\u884C
          '<color=#CF001C>git status</color>'\r\n\u9019\u500B\u6307\u4EE4\u80FD\u5920\u67E5\u770B\u66AB\u5B58\u5340\u57DF\u88E1\u9762\u7684\u5167\u5BB9"
