          You need to append the specified
          branch name after the command.

          Please look it up in the Game
          Manual for details.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "2. Git \u6307\u4EE4\u4E2D\uFF0C\u6709\u500B\u5207\u63DB\u81F3\u6307\u5B9A\u5206\u652F\u7684\u6307\u4EE4\r\n  
