      - title: en
        value: 'To switch to the 2nd commit version and check

          if the bug
          originates from this commit,

          you need to execute the ''<color=#CF001C>git
          checkout Commit_ID</color>'' command.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u70BA\u4E86\u5207\u63DB\u5230\u7B2C 2 \u500B\u63D0\u4EA4\u7248\u672C\u4EE5\u78BA\u8A8D\u932F\u8AA4\u4F86\u6E90\u662F\u5426\u4F86\u81EA\u9019\u500B\u63D0\u4EA4\r\n\u60A8\u9700\u8981\u57F7\u884C
