      - title: en
        value: "First, in the 'Command Line' window,\r\nplease ensure that the path
          is set to the project.\r\nThe project for this stage is located at the
          '<color=#CF001C>Home</color>' path.\r\n(You should be able to see the hidden
          .git folder.)\r"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u9996\u5148\u5728 '\u547D\u4EE4\u884C' \u8996\u7A97\u4E2D\uFF0C\u8ACB\u78BA\u4FDD\u5176\u8DEF\u5F91\u4F4D\u65BC\u5C08\u6848\u4E0A\r\n\u672C\u6B21\u95DC\u5361\u7684\u5C08\u6848\u5275\u5EFA\u65BC
          '<color=#CF001C>Home</color>' \u8DEF\u5F91\u4E0A\r\n\uFF08\u53EF\u4EE5\u770B\u5230
          .git \u96B1\u85CF\u8CC7\u6599\u593E\uFF09"
