      - title: en
        value: '1. Click on the file you want to edit in the ''File Manager'' window

          to
          open the ''File Content'' window.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "1. \u5728 '\u6A94\u6848\u7BA1\u7406' \u8996\u7A97\u4E2D\uFF0C\u8ACB\u9EDE\u64CA\u8981\u7DE8\u8F2F\u7684\u6587\u4EF6\r\n  
