          Clicking
          it will modify the content of that line.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "3. \u6BCF\u4E00\u884C\u5167\u5BB9\u5DE6\u908A\u7684\u925B\u7B46\u5716\u793A\r\n  
