        typeString: 
      - title: en
        value: '1. Make sure all the files you want to save are already in the staging
          area.

          If not, use the command to move the files into it.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "1. \u78BA\u8A8D\u8981\u4FDD\u5B58\u7684\u6240\u6709\u6587\u4EF6\u90FD\u5DF2\u7D93\u4F4D\u65BC\u66AB\u5B58\u5340\u57DF\u4E2D\r\n  
          \u6C92\u6709\u7684\u8A71\u8ACB\u901A\u904E\u6307\u4EE4\u5C07\u6587\u4EF6\u63A8\u5165\u4E0A\u53BB"
