      - title: en
        value: "3. Among Git commands, \nthere is a command used to view remote repository
          branches.\nAppending '<color=#CF001C>-r</color>' after this command type
          allows you to view them.\nPlease check the Game Manual for details."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "3. Git \u6307\u4EE4\u4E2D\uFF0C\u6709\u500B\u7528\u65BC\u67E5\u770B\u9060\u7AEF\u5132\u5B58\u5EAB\u5206\u652F\u7684\u6307\u4EE4\n  
          \u9019\u500B\u6307\u4EE4\u985E\u578B\u5F8C\u65B9\u52A0\u5165 '<color=#CF001C>-r</color>'
          \u5373\u53EF\u67E5\u770B\n   \u8A73\u7D30\u8ACB\u901A\u904E\u904A\u6232\u624B\u518A\u67E5\u627E"
