      - title: en
        value: 'We need to open the ''Web Browser'' window.

          This will
          allow us to access Git service platforms like GitHub.

          Please
          find the ''Web Browser'' button in the toolbar at the bottom of the game.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh
        value: "\u6211\u5011\u8981\u958B\u555F '\u7DB2\u9801\u700F\u89BD\u5668' \u8996\u7A97\n\u4F86\u9032\u5165
